{"type": "hitl_request", "replyId": "f975a9ddbaa5429ca5ab69a6ea96cb2c", "toolCalls": [{"id": "call_00_Vr3qniCPbCCZCflU3wmV5698", "name": "write_file", "input": {"path": "knowledge/questions/total_sales.yml", "reason": "新增常用问题：2025年有效订单销售额（PAID/COMPLETED 且未删除，金额分转元）", "content": "id: total_sales\nquestion: 2025年有效订单销售额是多少？\ndefinition: |\n  统计 2025 自然年（按 order_time）的有效订单销售额。\n  - 时间范围：order_time 落在 2025-01-01 00:00:00 至 2025-12-31 23:59:59 之间。\n  - 有效订单过滤：status 为 PAID 或 COMPLETED，且 is_deleted = 0。\n  - 金额口径：amount_cents 为分，除以 100 得到元；不扣退款。\n  - 统计粒度：全期汇总，无分组。\n  - 单位：元。\n  - 不涉及客户关联。\nsql: |\n  SELECT SUM(amount_cents) / 100.0 AS total_sales_amount\n  FROM \"order\"\n  WHERE order_time >= '2025-01-01 00:00:00'\n    AND order_time <= '2025-12-31 23:59:59'\n    AND status IN ('PAID', 'COMPLETED')\n    AND is_deleted = 0\nrequired: true\n"}}]}
